{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-shop-1-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-3","surface":"phone","area":"phone/shop-1","refs":["F-phone-312","F-phone-310"],"severity":"S4","title":"The note that the gym was not yet told about a leave is not kept and never updates","what":"When a member leaves the gym with no signal, the Gym tab says the gym will be told next time the app is online, and the app keeps trying on every start. That note lives only until the app closes, so after a restart nothing shows that the gym still has not been told. When the retry succeeds in the same session, the note still says the gym will be told. A member who switches to another gym while the old gym cannot be reached is never told at all, though the old gym keeps them as a member until a retry gets through.","expected":"The note stays while the leave is still waiting, also after a switch, and goes (or says the gym was told) once the gym confirms.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/gymActions.ts:540-542","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymActions.ts:195-197","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymActions.ts:236-243","apps/mobile/src/shop/pendingLeave.ts:53-80","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymStore.ts:96-103"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"leave-pending-note-not-kept","who":"gym members who leave or switch with no signal","how_often":"rare: only a leave sent with no signal","fix_line":"Show the waiting note from the kept list of unsent leaves, on leave and on switch, and clear it once the gym confirms.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
